Stage 4 multiplicity: Holm and BH over the 42 predicted-non-zero E1 contrasts of stage 2 (35 / 36 of 36 intervals survive Holm / BH) and of block R (36 / 36 of 36), committed with the tests that pin the counts and the recomputation

Exploratory (not part of prereg v1 or v2, no verdict changes). Generated by python -m memshift.analysis.multiplicity runs/stage4_multiplicity runs/stage2_e1 runs/stage4_rep_e1; the recomputed estimates and intervals equal e1_metrics.json exactly (deviation 0.0). The one contrast Holm removes in stage 2 is the S_def B x D interaction at cited granularity (Holm-adjusted p 0.073, BH q 0.012).

